# Explicitly installed by the CachyOS installer (KDE Plasma, Limine, ext4) on scourge, 2026-10-20:
# `pacman -Qqe` limited to what /var/log/pacman.log shows installed before the first command after
# first boot. The baseline the drift check subtracts (src/lib/arch.ts); regenerate after a reinstall.
# Removed since, by choice (2026-10-20): alacritty, konsole (Ghostty is the terminal), firefox (Chrome);
# ufw and its KDE page (no firewall); Wi-Fi, modem and VPN tools (wired only, Twingate); filesystem and
# RAID tools other than ext4/FAT/exFAT; os-prober; vim, micro, the zsh config; glances, meld, reflector,
# dnsmasq; the X11 amdgpu driver; Bluetooth (no adapter); kate, kdeconnect, shelly, cachyos-packageinstaller.
